text:
When Mrs. Alice Edith Dickason-B Blythe von Brahmstead got sober Tn the City Prison Monday night she was released on s cash bail. She consented to meet her husband John w. von Brahmstead, a barber at O'Farrell street, to talk over fhe possibility of withdrawing the divorce sni+ she has instituted against him.

 About 1 o'clock yesterday morning they were creating a disturbance at Eddy and Mason streets, when Special Officer Hugh Smith nlaced them under arrest. The Husband showed fight, and Smith hit him in inc eve, raising big lump on it. They were taken to the City Prison and booked for disturbing the peace;

 They appeared before Judge Mogan yes- terday. and the Judge. after giving them both a lecture, dismissed the cases.

